---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Corrections and challenges"><div class="page-heading"><span class="kicker">ACCOUNTABILITY LOG</span><h1>Corrections & challenges</h1><p>Publisher corrections and challenges to our records belong in an auditable log with source links and dates.</p></div><div id="correction-list" class="empty panel" style="margin-top:30px"><strong>No corrections recorded</strong><p>No correction or challenge has been added to the current file. This does not mean no publisher correction exists. See the original source page for its latest state.</p></div><div class="prose"><h2>What we change</h2><p>We update incorrect metadata, add missing context, and revise classifications when evidence warrants it. An entry should retain the original and updated dates, the source of the change, and a record of the review.</p></div><script is:inline>fetch('/api/corrections').then(r=>r.ok?r.json():[]).then(rows=>{if(!rows.length)return;const list=document.getElementById('correction-list');list.className='correction-list';list.replaceChildren();for(const row of rows){const card=document.createElement('article');card.className='panel correction-card';const title=document.createElement('h2');title.textContent=row.headline;const date=document.createElement('time');date.textContent=row.published_at;const description=document.createElement('p');description.textContent=row.description;const link=document.createElement('a');link.href=row.source_url;link.target='_blank';link.rel='noopener noreferrer';link.textContent='Publisher correction ↗';card.append(date,title,description,link);list.append(card)}}).catch(()=>{});</script></Base>
<style>.correction-list{display:grid;gap:12px;margin-top:30px}.correction-card{padding:22px}.correction-card h2{font:600 22px 'Playfair Display',serif;margin:9px 0}.correction-card p{color:#aab9c6}.correction-card a{color:#ef877f}.correction-card time{font:11px 'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;color:#91a4b4}</style>
